+ ## REST API Alternative
+ Instead of `structsd query`, you can hit the **Consensus Network REST API** directly — useful when `structsd` is not installed or for programmatic access.
+ **Base URLs:**
+ - Local: `http://localhost:1317`
+ - Public testnet (chain only): `https://public.testnet.structs.network`
+ | Entity | REST Endpoint |
+ | Player | `GET /structs/player/{id}` or `/structs/player` |
+ | Planet | `GET /structs/planet/{id}`, `/structs/planet_by_player/{playerId}` |
+ | Struct | `GET /structs/struct/{id}` or `/structs/struct` |
+ | Fleet | `GET /structs/fleet/{id}`, `/structs/fleet_by_index/{index}` |
+ | Guild | `GET /structs/guild/{id}` or `/structs/guild` |
+ | Reactor | `GET /structs/reactor/{id}` or `/structs/reactor` |
+ | Substation | `GET /structs/substation/{id}` or `/structs/substation` |
+ | Provider | `GET /structs/provider/{id}` or `/structs/provider` |
+ | Agreement | `GET /structs/agreement/{id}`, `/structs/agreement_by_provider/{providerId}` |
+ | Allocation | `GET /structs/allocation/{id}`, `/structs/allocation_by_source/{sourceId}`, `/structs/allocation_by_destination/{destinationId}` |
+ | Address | `GET /structs/address/{address}`, `/structs/address_by_player/{playerId}` |
+ | Permission | `GET /structs/permission/object/{objectId}`, `/structs/permission/player/{playerId}` |
+ | Guild rank perms | `GET /structs/guild_rank_permission_by_object/{objectId}` |
+ | Block height | `GET /blockheight` |
+ | Chain params | `GET /structs/params` |
+ **Important:** Consensus Network returns HTTP 200 even for not-found — check `response.code`. Code `1900` = object not found. Paginate with `?pagination.key=...&pagination.limit=N`.
+ ### Webapp API (Enhanced Stats)
+ The **Webapp API** provides enriched data, ledger history, guild rosters, shield health, time-series stats, and more. It runs at `http://localhost:8080` locally or `http://crew.oh.energy` (Orbital Hydro public).
+ **Auth:** POST `/api/auth/login` with body `{address, signature, pubkey, guild_id, unix_timestamp}`. Sign the message `LOGIN_GUILD{guildId}ADDRESS{address}DATETIME{unix_timestamp}` (unix_timestamp must be within 600s of server time). On success, the server sets a `PHPSESSID` cookie — include it on subsequent requests.
+ **Public routes (no cookie needed):** `/api/auth/*`, `/api/guild/this`, `/api/timestamp`, `/api/setting`
+ **Response envelope:** `{"success": true, "errors": {}, "data": ...}` — always unwrap `data`.
+ | What | Endpoint |
+ |------|----------|
+ | Player (enriched) | `GET /api/player/{player_id}` |
+ | Player ore stats | `GET /api/player/{player_id}/ore/stats` |
+ | Planet (enriched) | `GET /api/planet/{planet_id}` |
+ | Planet shield health | `GET /api/planet/{planet_id}/shield/health` |
+ | Active raid | `GET /api/planet/{planet_id}/raid/active` |
+ | Guild (enriched) | `GET /api/guild/{guild_id}` |
+ | Guild roster | `GET /api/guild/{guild_id}/roster` |
+ | Guild power stats | `GET /api/guild/{guild_id}/power/stats` |
+ | Guild directory | `GET /api/guild/directory` |
+ | Struct by planet | `GET /api/struct/planet/{planet_id}` |
+ | Ledger | `GET /api/ledger/player/{player_id}/page/{page}` |
+ | Live tunables | `GET /api/setting` |
+ | Time-series stat | `GET /api/stat/{metric}/object/{key}/range/page/{page}?start_time=&end_time=` (max 7-day window) |
+ **Catalog reads (any entity):** `GET /api/{entity}[/{filter}]/page/{page}` — 1-indexed, page size 100, `data` is a flat array. Fetch page+1 while `data.length === 100`.
+ Examples: `/api/allocation/source/{source_id}/page/1`, `/api/permission/object/{object_id}/page/1`, `/api/struct-defender/protected/{struct_id}/page/1`
+ **Gotchas:**
+ - No `GET /api/reactor/{id}` or `/api/substation/{id}` in webapp — use consensus API for single-entity lookups of those
+ - `PUT /api/player/username` removed in v0.16.0 — now on-chain via `MsgPlayerUpdateName`
+ - Rate limits: Consensus 60/min, Webapp 100/min, RPC 30/min